// Rubix/Yahoo research: TradingView Confirmed-Daily-Bar Webhook Alert (Pine v5)
//
// Purpose: emit ONE JSON payload per symbol, only on a confirmed (closed)
// daily bar, for manual research use with providers/tradingview_webhook_receiver.py.
//
// This script never fires on the forming/live bar (barstate.isconfirmed gates
// everything). It never trades, never places orders, and never reads or writes
// account/broker state. It is display/alert-only.
//
// SETUP (manual, per official TradingView docs — not automated by this repo):
//   1. Add this script to the chart for ONE EGX symbol on the Daily (1D) timeframe.
//   2. Create an alert on this script's "Confirmed Daily Bar" condition.
//   3. Alert trigger: "Once Per Bar Close" (so it fires exactly once, after close).
//   4. Webhook URL: your own HTTPS endpoint running providers/tradingview_webhook_receiver.py.
//   5. Your TradingView account must have 2FA enabled (TradingView requirement
//      for webhook alerts) and a plan whose active-alert quota covers your
//      symbol count (see TRADINGVIEW_ACCESS_CAPABILITY_REPORT.md).
//   6. Repeat per symbol — one alert instance per chart/symbol, per TradingView's
//      documented alert model.
//
// The receiver independently re-validates every field; this script does not
// need to be trusted blindly.

//@version=5
indicator("EGX Confirmed Daily Bar Webhook (Research)", overlay=true)

// Fires exactly once, on the first tick of the NEXT bar after the daily bar
// closed — this is the standard, documented way to detect a confirmed bar in
// Pine without ever alerting on the still-forming bar.
confirmedBar = barstate.isconfirmed and timeframe.period == "1D"

if confirmedBar
    payload = '{' +
      '"schema_version":1,' +
      '"source":"TRADINGVIEW_OFFICIAL_ALERT",' +
      '"ticker":"' + syminfo.ticker + '",' +
      '"ticker_id":"' + syminfo.tickerid + '",' +
      '"exchange":"' + syminfo.exchange + '",' +
      '"interval":"' + timeframe.period + '",' +
      '"bar_time":"' + str.tostring(time) + '",' +
      '"bar_close_time":"' + str.tostring(time_close) + '",' +
      '"open":' + str.tostring(open) + ',' +
      '"high":' + str.tostring(high) + ',' +
      '"low":' + str.tostring(low) + ',' +
      '"close":' + str.tostring(close) + ',' +
      '"volume":' + str.tostring(volume) + ',' +
      '"confirmed":true' +
      '}'
    alert(payload, alert.freq_once_per_bar_close)
